Shelves was written from scratch. It follows the general idea of a living-room game
library as rows of games, one row per section, under the focused game's art; it contains
no console or store names, logos, button art, brand colours or layout numbers, and takes
its only colour from the game art it shows.

preview.svg, the picture of Shelves' Home on its card in Quick Access, was drawn for Pindu
launcher by an AI agent (#721) as a schematic in the design's own colours: it holds no game
art, no text and no logos.
